{"id": "0195", "language": "zh", "kind": "reference", "text": "啟示錄第一章第一節", "target": [66, 1, 1], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "duration_s": 2.234625, "sha256": "b2c10dc74046061d214e4743ef84376c02808baab9ec0cc2f9f44ee7c9e7e406", "transcript": "啟示錄機, 扎機一節", "decode_s": 1.1016617090208456, "cpu_s": 0.0642990000000001, "rtf": 0.4929962338293207, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 4, "units": 9, "reference": null, "reference_correct": false}
{"id": "0200", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我已將你的名指示他們，還要指示他們，使你所愛我的愛在他們裏面，我也在他們裏面。」", "target": [43, 17, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 7.6585, "sha256": "424a1e079b7762618fc5b88f6f03569ed749f15dd5cd84631b377b807cee2c8e", "transcript": "我已將你的名指示他們, 還要指示他們, 使你所愛我的愛在他們裡面, 我也在他們裡面。", "decode_s": 1.2085304170614108, "cpu_s": 0.09741300000000042, "rtf": 0.15780249618873288, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 2, "units": 35, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0205", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "耶穌說：「狐狸有洞，天空的飛鳥有窩，只是人子沒有枕頭的地方。」", "target": [42, 9, 58], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.9879375, "sha256": "ac50e6bee5207129e498a63d97b4b2955b209be9f3546b948a4f18c399308f43", "transcript": "耶穌說, 湖里有洞, 天空的飛鳥有窝, 只是人最沒有枕頭的地方。", "decode_s": 1.00541795801837, "cpu_s": 0.08969499999999986, "rtf": 0.167907223149602, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 3, "units": 25, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0210", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "並使他的兒子經火，又觀兆，用法術，立交鬼的和行巫術的，多行耶和華眼中看爲惡的事，惹動他的怒氣；", "target": [12, 21, 6], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 11.6820625, "sha256": "185eba70c75be61592970fd9a7951f4cdde6d961c3758e1e771ac78f2767cd64", "transcript": "並使他的兒子驚火, 又觀照, 用法術, 利交鬼的汗形巫術的, 多形耶和華眼中看慰惡的事, 惹動他的怒氣", "decode_s": 1.0661676659947261, "cpu_s": 0.13422, "rtf": 0.09126536225899545, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 7, "units": 41, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0215", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我們出錢才得水喝； 我們的柴是人賣給我們的。", "target": [25, 5, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 3.7561875, "sha256": "d6d581a24a30285d7e618d4214660a87ea387e67cac5e7a16cf67d60df025fe3", "transcript": "我們出錢才的水喝, 我們的才是人賣給我們的", "decode_s": 1.0036512080114335, "cpu_s": 0.07146299999999961, "rtf": 0.267199443055341, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 2, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0220", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "不可露你兒婦的下體；她是你兒子的妻，不可露她的下體。", "target": [3, 18, 15], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.3570625, "sha256": "6c5c3d6b34682f9a1957506a739062d4b1ddca8feb8654a1d6d3c1dc8dde7ae8", "transcript": "不可錄你兒父的下體, 它是你兒子的妻, 不可錄他的下體。", "decode_s": 1.058426916017197, "cpu_s": 0.08259799999999995, "rtf": 0.19757598796302958, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 5, "units": 23, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0225", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "說：「以掃若來擊殺這一隊，剩下的那一隊還可以逃避。」", "target": [1, 32, 8], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.8491875, "sha256": "dd8b36777f59b916bea82159fcf9101aaee55236caefc5cb874cdf2f8006dbf1", "transcript": "說, 以扫羅來擊殺這一隊, 剩下的那一隊還可以逃避", "decode_s": 0.9440317089902237, "cpu_s": 0.08102699999999974, "rtf": 0.16139535772963742, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 1, "units": 21, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0230", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "麥西生路低人、亞拿米人、利哈比人、拿弗土希人、", "target": [1, 10, 13], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.187875, "sha256": "fac345f1232a649e07e1ed0e1b81aadda177d7c74c0c9c782d567fc53608eb7b", "transcript": "麥西生路滴人, 亞拿米人, 利哈比人, 拿福吐西人", "decode_s": 0.9737633329350501, "cpu_s": 0.09420699999999993, "rtf": 0.1876998449143532, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 4, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0235", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "一月之內，我除滅三個牧人，因爲我的心厭煩他們；他們的心也憎嫌我。", "target": [38, 11, 8], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 6.277, "sha256": "58b1431c312ed2ba3ed562dc447e2781db217ec01002ce70e9f19bbe208318d7", "transcript": "一月之內, 我除灭三個牧人, 因我的心仰藏他們, 他們的心也尊賢我", "decode_s": 1.0702323330333456, "cpu_s": 0.11773199999999928, "rtf": 0.1705006106473388, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 5, "units": 28, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0240", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "七月二十三日，王遣散衆民；他們因見耶和華向大衛和所羅門與他民以色列所施的恩惠，就都心中喜樂，各歸各家去了。", "target": [14, 7, 10], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 13.3354375, "sha256": "e26bec90520c9bd6aa84b66b1223db41036e4b29b0be4e557317794c6835606d", "transcript": "7月23日, 王遣散眾鳴, 他們應見耶和華向大衛和所羅門, 與他名以色列所施的恩惠, 就都心中喜樂, 各歸各家去了。", "decode_s": 1.293637791997753, "cpu_s": 0.2097920000000002, "rtf": 0.09700752539972934, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 4, "units": 47, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0245", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "惟恐多說，你嫌煩絮，只求你寬容聽我們說幾句話。", "target": [44, 24, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.8430625, "sha256": "00ef4e9f454443ba713334f6b9e4d9a103b4fd4941c7766ec1fd80094eaf1b45", "transcript": "唯恐多說, 你嫌凡事, 只求你寬容聽我們說幾句話", "decode_s": 1.225287584005855, "cpu_s": 0.12383100000000002, "rtf": 0.25299850745387964, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 3, "units": 20, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0250", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "所羅門在耶路撒冷作以色列衆人的王共四十年。", "target": [11, 11, 42], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.77875, "sha256": "d74109bdae85bf1ffaa5fc992e79800ef803e43b773470941f7a8a9e75e0905e", "transcript": "所羅門在耶路撒冷做以色列眾人的王共四十年", "decode_s": 1.0285992920398712, "cpu_s": 0.09715100000000021, "rtf": 0.21524442417784384, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 2, "units": 20, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0255", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "主－我們的 神是憐憫饒恕人的，我們卻違背了他，", "target": [27, 9, 9], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.662875, "sha256": "b0fc20dbfb23b132ccaa91ac7984e79b15f3729b3ad2f0f570fbbf9fc15bdf3f", "transcript": "我們 卻違背了祂", "decode_s": 0.9653641659533605, "cpu_s": 0.06741299999999928, "rtf": 0.20703196331734403, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 13, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0260", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "從那日起，我的僕人一半做工，一半拿槍、拿盾牌、拿弓、穿 鎧甲，官長都站在猶大衆人的後邊。", "target": [16, 4, 16], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 9.3191875, "sha256": "83b250bbda44fc0b81eb0c1eca1227460bc1c705a3dc4e45a2a1e45c7d17aad6", "transcript": "從那日起, 我的仆人一半做工, 一半拿槍, 拿盾牌, 拿弓, 穿铠甲, 官長都站在由大眾人的後邊", "decode_s": 1.1417662090389058, "cpu_s": 0.15432500000000005, "rtf": 0.1225177848432501, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 2, "units": 36, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0265", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "埃及中，無論是頭與尾， 棕枝與蘆葦，所做之工都不成就。", "target": [23, 19, 15], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.4676875, "sha256": "35b50527bede503d5e471d0703dcb15a95ed4d8974022841aec304b637ef7d86", "transcript": "阿吉中, 無論是頭與尾, 宗之與盧尾, 所作之功都不成就。", "decode_s": 0.9689416670007631, "cpu_s": 0.10752400000000062, "rtf": 0.177212334648014, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 8, "units": 22, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0270", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "願憐恤、平安、慈愛多多地加給你們。", "target": [65, 1, 2], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.3475, "sha256": "a33bf219e5380b0db08f50eb101f6f6f7bf81195133ec96b7aaddfe9c41d6f76", "transcript": "願連續, 平安, 慈愛多多地加及你們", "decode_s": 0.9156081669498235, "cpu_s": 0.07140699999999978, "rtf": 0.2106056738239962, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 3, "units": 14, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0275", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "你們不要自欺；濫交是敗壞善行。", "target": [46, 15, 33], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 2.889, "sha256": "8cb0ae1b49a7f7f3f048c169debb18155cfd4a5e9026bdd92fbc7aca36dd3795", "transcript": "你仍不要罪欺, 亂交失敗換上行", "decode_s": 1.012588250101544, "cpu_s": 0.05398499999999995, "rtf": 0.3504978366568169, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 6, "units": 13, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0280", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "並且因爲他是人子，就賜給他行審判的權柄。", "target": [43, 5, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.649375, "sha256": "eef60d763cc19b9b22428a36c5403745a26382eb0756534482552fadf7d682fe", "transcript": "並且因為他是人子, 就賜給他行審判的權柄", "decode_s": 1.011745166964829, "cpu_s": 0.0659800000000006, "rtf": 0.2176088543008101, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 1, "units": 18, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0285", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "那獻供物的就要將細面伊法十分之一，並油一欣四分之一，調和作素祭，獻給耶和華。", "target": [4, 15, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 8.774375, "sha256": "547dbd6a18ccf53b7598322e95b8b32b45fa6b0ffe669274de85ffe7dc0f24dc", "transcript": "那憲供物罪就要將信念依法十分之一, 並留意信四分之一, 調合作素季, 献給耶和華", "decode_s": 0.9326132499845698, "cpu_s": 0.08992100000000036, "rtf": 0.10628828263945522, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 10, "units": 35, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0290", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "說假預言的先知，就是預言本心詭詐的先知，他們這樣存心要到幾時呢？ 他們各人將所做的夢對鄰舍述說，想要使我的百姓忘記我的名，正如他們列祖因巴力忘記我的名一樣。", "target": [24, 23, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 15.1954375, "sha256": "0f34e7a970e48f75cdbfe2b722548b91e0cd9e80afd278c12da95b23feb762b2", "transcript": "说假預言的先知, 就是預言本心鬼诈的先知, 他們這樣存心要到幾時呢? 他們個人將所做的夢對林社述說, 想要使我的百姓忘記我的名, 正如他們列祖因巴利忘記我的名一樣。 正如他們列祖因巴利忘記我的名一樣。 正如他們列祖因巴利忘記我的名一樣。 正如他們列祖因巴利忘記我的名一樣。 正如他們列祖因巴利忘記我的名一樣。 正如他們列祖因巴利忘記我的名一樣。 正如他們列祖因巴利忘記我的名一樣。 正如他們列祖因巴利忘記我的名一樣。 正如他們列祖因巴利忘記我的名一樣。 正如他們列祖因巴利忘記我的名一樣。", "decode_s": 1.623199750087224, "cpu_s": 0.2241270000000002, "rtf": 0.10682152126829016, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 149, "units": 73, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0295", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我們要爲你編上金辮，鑲上銀釘。 〔新娘〕 王正坐席的時候， 我的哪噠香膏發出香味。", "target": [22, 1, 11], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 7.5255625, "sha256": "b66706466c716444a2b8456c6eea8cb9e669531ac1e484ae6c86ce588a64ffd2", "transcript": "我們要你邊上筋片, 蝦上一度, 新娘花中作息的時候, 我跟拿大蝦高發出香味", "decode_s": 0.9116212920052931, "cpu_s": 0.05351200000000045, "rtf": 0.12113663158139913, "max_rss_bytes": 450527232, "edits": 16, "units": 32, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
